      { "id": "headphones-product", "kind": "image", "title": "图片1", "x": 170, "y": 45, "width": 300, "content": "根据这个产品 超写实商业产品摄影，8K 超清，REVOR 银色金属头戴式耳机悬空悬浮在带环形灯带的透明亚克力展台上方，整体完整构图，冷灰渐变极简背景，柔和影棚侧逆光勾勒金属机身轮廓，细腻金属哑光质感，黑色皮质头梁耳罩，氛围感光影，浅景深，画面干净高级，科技轻奢风，镜面地面倒影，居中构图，慢镜头氛围感，极致画质，产品居中完整展示", "version": 1, "createdAt": 1, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
      { "id": "headphones-poster", "kind": "image", "title": "图片2", "x": 620, "y": 887, "width": 300, "content": "高端产品定格海报，头戴耳机悬浮于发光透明展台上方，完整整机居中构图，冷灰渐变高级背景，柔和环绕影棚光，金属机身质感通透，镜面倒影干净利落，画面构图规整大气，8K 超清写实 构图稳重 @[node:headphones-product] ", "version": 1, "createdAt": 2, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
      { "id": "headphones-logo-detail", "kind": "image", "title": "图片3", "x": 620, "y": 45, "width": 300, "content": "微距产品特写镜头，环绕视角聚焦 REVOR 耳机外侧 LOGO 区域，细腻磨砂金属外壳纹理清晰可见，特写耳机伸缩转轴结构、侧边功能按键、壳体精密开孔做工，光影凸显金属精密加工质感，浅景深虚化背景，冷调影棚布光，超写实 8K，细节拉满，工业精密质感，突出产品做工用料优势，局部特写构图 @[node:headphones-product] ", "version": 1, "createdAt": 3, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
      { "id": "headphones-band-detail", "kind": "image", "title": "图片4", "x": 620, "y": 1308, "width": 300, "content": "@[node:headphones-product] 微距产品特写镜头 REVOR 耳机上方头梁区域，冷调影棚布光，超写实 8K，细节拉满，工业精密质感，突出产品做工用料优势，局部特写构图", "version": 1, "createdAt": 4, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
      { "id": "headphones-model", "kind": "image", "title": "模特图", "x": 170, "y": 887, "width": 300, "content": "", "version": 1, "createdAt": 5, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
      { "id": "headphones-earpad-detail", "kind": "image", "title": "图片5", "x": 620, "y": 466, "width": 300, "content": "微距特写 REVOR 耳机全包式蛋白皮耳罩，全包耳结构，黑色亲肤皮质，镜头近距离对焦耳罩材质纹理，影棚柔和柔光，冷灰极简背景，8K 超写实产品摄影，慢动作质感，浅景深，质感细腻 @[node:headphones-product] ", "version": 1, "createdAt": 6, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
      { "id": "headphones-studio", "kind": "image", "title": "图片6", "x": 170, "y": 466, "width": 300, "content": "生成一个背景为冷调影棚，场景内放着一个灰色简约的中性沙发", "version": 1, "createdAt": 7, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
      { "id": "headphones-full-model", "kind": "image", "title": "图片7", "x": 620, "y": 1729, "width": 300, "content": "参考 @[node:headphones-model] 生成全身照 背景为冷调影棚 去除水印 8K", "version": 1, "createdAt": 8, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
      { "id": "headphones-neck-shot", "kind": "image", "title": "图片8", "x": 1070, "y": 45, "width": 300, "content": "@[node:headphones-product] 参考产品带到 @[node:headphones-full-model] 正面面对镜头，只露出鼻子以下的部分，身体半身，突出产品戴在脖子上的效果，背景为冷调影棚", "version": 1, "createdAt": 9, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
      { "id": "headphones-typography", "kind": "image", "title": "图片9", "x": 1070, "y": 466, "width": 300, "content": "@[node:headphones-poster] 在冷灰渐变高级背景、柔和环绕影棚光下，产品保持正面没有任何效果，产品左边字体为 Sounds，右边字体为 of Nature，字体要灰色简约风格", "version": 1, "createdAt": 10, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
      { "id": "headphones-wearing", "kind": "image", "title": "图片10", "x": 1070, "y": 1308, "width": 300, "content": "@[node:headphones-product] 人物上半身戴上产品 @[node:headphones-full-model]，正面，双手摸着耳机两侧，背景为冷调影棚", "version": 1, "createdAt": 11, "imageWidth": 1024, "imageHeight": 1024, "imageAutoSize": true, "imageCount": 1 },
      { "id": "headphones-video", "kind": "video", "title": "视频素材", "x": 1520, "y": 45, "width": 300, "content": "开始2秒产品展示，然后产品 @[node:headphones-poster] 进行旋转，带旋转音效，然后切换镜头 @[node:headphones-logo-detail] @[node:headphones-earpad-detail] @[node:headphones-band-detail]，共计三秒的镜头，配效果音效；转场到 @[node:headphones-neck-shot]，中景效果人物自然衔接到 @[node:headphones-wearing]，时长3秒；自然转场到 @[node:headphones-listening]，主角享受听歌的感觉；最后 @[node:headphones-typography] 缓慢出现2秒，画面定格，专业广告配音 Get Heavenly Voices Instantly", "version": 1, "createdAt": 12, "videoAspectWidth": 16, "videoAspectHeight": 9, "videoAutoSize": true, "videoDuration": 5, "videoResolution": 720 },
